    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Ceramite Sentinels",
    "summary": "Friendly ADEPTUS ASTARTES may re-roll Wound results of 1 on attacks made while their unit is inside a terrain area. To count as Entrenched, it must be in a terrain area, have skipped setup this turn and have no model that moved farther than 3 inches this turn. Defensive Mastery lets friendly units of either TOR GARADON or DARNATH LYSANDER count as Entrenched as each phase begins, ignoring the normal conditions. IMPERIAL FISTS are permitted. ADEPTUS ASTARTES from other named Chapters are excluded.",
